{
  "id": "page-name-data-element",
  "note": "A tagging brief that needs a NEW data element created and then referenced by a rule component in the same library. The property has 'core' installed but no 'Page Name' data element yet, so the agent must create it (reactor_create_data_element) before a component references %Page Name% — the Phase 4 reference check resolves it against data elements created THIS run. Scripted Reactor tools stand in for live MCP writes.",
  "category": "launch",
  "request": "In Launch property \"Acme Web\" (library \"Web Tagging Dev\"), capture the page name from the data-layer path digitalData.page.pageInfo.pageName as a data element called \"Page Name\" (persist it for the pageview), then add a window-loaded rule whose custom-code action logs %Page Name%. Populate the dev library — do not publish it.",
  "maxSteps": 18,
  "knowledge": {
    "results": [
      {
        "title": "Launch data element from a JavaScript variable",
        "content": "A data element reading a data-layer path uses core::dataElements::javascript-variable with settings.path set to the dotted path, and storage_duration one of pageview/session/visitor. Rule components reference it as %Data Element Name%."
      }
    ]
  },
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "reactor_list_extensions",
      "description": "List installed extensions on a tag property.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "property_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Reactor property ID"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Number to return (default 50)"
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": [
        {
          "result": {
            "property_id": "PR-ACME",
            "count": 2,
            "extensions": [
              {
                "id": "EX1",
                "name": "core",
                "version": "3.4.0",
                "enabled": true
              },
              {
                "id": "EX2",
                "name": "adobe-analytics",
                "version": "1.9.0",
                "enabled": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "reactor_list_data_elements",
      "description": "List data elements defined on a tag property.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "property_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Reactor property ID"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Number to return (default 50)"
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": [
        {
          "result": {
            "property_id": "PR-ACME",
            "count": 1,
            "data_elements": [
              {
                "id": "DE1",
                "name": "Page Name",
                "type": "core::dataElements::javascript-variable",
                "enabled": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "reactor_create_data_element",
      "description": "Create a data element on a tag property.",
      "inputSchema": {
